    "No direct experimental bioavailability measurement for the query molecule itself is included in the provided evidence.",
    "No specific data on first-pass metabolism, efflux transport, or solubility-limited absorption for the query are available.",
    "The physicochemical prior is favorable but not a substitute for direct in vivo evidence."
  ],
